<title>USA: Supervalu sees gain on ShopKo/Phar-Mor deal.</title>
<headline>Supervalu sees gain on ShopKo/Phar-Mor deal.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Supervalu Inc said it expects to realize an unspecified gain on the sale of 14.7 million shares of ShopKo Stores Inc for about $248 million to Phar-Mor Inc.</p>
<p>It said the deal is expected to close in December.</p>
<p>The company said it is considering a number of alternatives for use of the proceeds from the transaction.</p>
<p>&quot;We intend to use these proceeds in a manner that avoids earnings per share dilution,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
